# What must never leave this folder for a public URL.
#
# `vercel link` writes .env.local with a live VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN into this very
# directory, so the credential sits beside the files being uploaded. The CLI
# already honours .gitignore, but a deployment is public and irreversible —
# this file states the exclusion instead of relying on that.
.env
.env.*
.vercel

# Package documentation, not site content. Nothing in the portal links to a
# .md file; serving them adds nothing and widens what is public.
*.md
**/*.md

# Linting configuration that travelled with the design-system package.
_ds/adama-brandwell/_adherence.oxlintrc.json
